  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "In the year 2187, a terraforming expedition was sent to PlanetX94, an
    uncharted world filled with mineral anomalies and strange electromagnetic pulses.
    For six months, the crew transmitted promising updates. Then, without warning,
    the signal went dark.\n\nYou are a LiDAR reconnaissance specialist. Alone and
    equipped with a high-frequency scanning device, your mission is to map the terrain
    and recover fragmented data logs scattered across the planet's surface.\n\nBut
    something is wrong.\n\nYour scans reveal more than just landscape. Ghostly silhouettes
    of the lost crew flicker into view. Shadows move where no life should exist.
    And in the distance, something listens.\n\nThe planet is not empty. It never
    was.\n\nYou are not the first.\nAnd if you're not careful,\nyou won\u2019t be
    the last."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
